+              THINKING_BUDGET_EVIDENCE="container ${c} was booted WITHOUT --reasoning-parser in its argv, and its boot log cannot confirm or deny one (${logfacts#LOG }); a launcher inside the image can set the parser where neither source sees it — vLLM v0.29.0 rejects thinking_token_budget per request without a parser (VLLMValidationError)"
